# Model registry for setup.sh / bench.sh
#
# Format:  KEY|ollama-reference|size_gb|note[|renderer]
# renderer (optional) is an Ollama RENDERER/PARSER name. setup.sh --alias writes it
# into the alias Modelfile; without it tool calls can come back as raw text.
# Sizes are the real GGUF file sizes from Hugging Face (verified 2026-10).
# Do not put a pipe (|) or a comment hash inside a field.
#
# Pulling goes through hf.co so we never depend on guessed Ollama library tags.
# Select with: ./setup.sh --set KEY1,KEY2   (--all pulls every key below)

# --- current favourite ------------------------------------------------------
